 "missing": [],
 "notes": "Sound strings and volumes are client-only and carry no recorded state. The aux SFX 1015 on take-off draws nothing and writes no state. The dev summon goes through createEntityFromNBT, whose readEntityFromNBT reads BatFlags 0, so a summoned bat starts flying (dev.c mirrors it). The client copy of a hanging bat is not where the server bat hangs (it sits on the floor below), so a melee hit on a hanging bat depends on the client entity model; the gate uses an arrow."
